WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.600
Have you ever wondered what SCP-4999,&nbsp;
Someone to Watch Over Us, wants?

00:00:04.600 --> 00:00:10.300
Foundation staff took a picture of&nbsp;
SCP-4999 with SCP-978, The Desire Camera,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:10.300 --> 00:00:14.080
while it was standing next to a supine Stage IV&nbsp;
cancer patient at a Hospital, smoking a cigarette.

00:00:14.080 --> 00:00:15.040
This was the result:

00:00:15.040 --> 00:00:22.180
"The same photo, except SCP-4999 is absent and the&nbsp;
patient is standing and next to a man instead."

00:00:22.180 --> 00:00:27.100
The result is difficult to decipher,&nbsp;
but it does seem that SCP-4999 wishes&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:27.100 --> 00:00:30.880
it could do more than just provide&nbsp;
comfort in a person's final moments.

